"7688413" href="7688413#7688413">A377</a></div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="1" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="2" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="3" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Div. 2</div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="4" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"></div></td><td align="left" charoff="50" class="entry" startcol="5" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;">Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7688418" href="7688418#7688418">A381</a></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678197 child"
      id="7678197"
      data-guid="7678197"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="142"
      data-full-title="§ 1-2: Continuation of existing provisions."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678197_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678197_label" for="7678197_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678197"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-2
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678197"
    >
Continuation of existing provisions.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678197" data-guid="7678197"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678197" data-guid="7678197" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678197_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The provisions of the Code, insofar as they are substantively the same as those of local laws, ordinances and resolutions in force immediately prior to the enactment of the Code by this local law, are intended as a continuation of such local laws, ordinances and resolutions and not as new enactments, and the effectiveness of such provisions shall date from the date of adoption of the prior local law, ordinance or resolution. All such provisions are hereby continued in full force and effect and are hereby reaffirmed as to their adoption by the Mayor of the City of Albany, and it is the intention of said Mayor that each such provision contained within the Code is hereby reaffirmed as it appears in said Code. Only such provisions of former local laws and ordinances as are omitted from this Code shall be deemed repealed or abrogated by the provisions of § <a class="xref" guid="7678198" href="7678198#7678198">1-3</a> below.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678198 child"
      id="7678198"
      data-guid="7678198"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="143"
      data-full-title="§ 1-3: Repeal of enactments not included in Code."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678198_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678198_label" for="7678198_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678198"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-3
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678198"
    >
Repeal of enactments not included in Code.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678198" data-guid="7678198"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678198" data-guid="7678198" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678198_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">All local laws and ordinances of a general and permanent nature of the City of Albany in force on the date of the adoption of this local law and not contained in such Code or recognized and continued in force by reference therein are hereby repealed from and after the effective date of this local law.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678199 child"
      id="7678199"
      data-guid="7678199"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="144"
      data-full-title="§ 1-4: Enactments saved from repeal; matters not affected."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678199_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678199_label" for="7678199_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678199"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-4
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678199"
    >
Enactments saved from repeal; matters not affected.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678199" data-guid="7678199"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678199" data-guid="7678199" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678199_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The repeal of local laws and ordinances provided for in § <a class="xref" guid="7678198" href="7678198#7678198">1-3</a> of this local law shall not affect the following classes of local laws, ordinances, rights and obligations, which are hereby expressly saved from repeal:</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="7678200"><a alt="1-4A" class="litem_number" href="7678200#7678200" onclick="return false;" title="1-4A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any right or liability established, accrued or incurred under any legislative provision of the City of Albany prior to the effective date of this local law or any action or proceeding brought for the enforcement of such right or liability.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678201"><a alt="1-4B" class="litem_number" href="7678201#7678201" onclick="return false;" title="1-4B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any offense or act committed or done before the effective date of this local law in violation of any legislative provision of the City of Albany or any penalty, punishment or forfeiture which may result therefrom.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678202"><a alt="1-4C" class="litem_number" href="7678202#7678202" onclick="return false;" title="1-4C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any prosecution, indictment, action, suit or other proceeding pending or any judgment rendered prior to the effective date of this local law brought pursuant to any legislative provision of the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678203"><a alt="1-4D" class="litem_number" href="7678203#7678203" onclick="return false;" title="1-4D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any franchise, license, right, easement or privilege heretofore granted or conferred by the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678204"><a alt="1-4E" class="litem_number" href="7678204#7678204" onclick="return false;" title="1-4E">E. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any local law or ordinance of the City of Albany providing for the laying out, opening, altering, widening, relocating, straightening, establishing grade, changing name, improvement, acceptance or vacation of any right-of-way, easement, street, road, highway, park or other public place within the City of Albany or any portion thereof.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678205"><a alt="1-4F" class="litem_number" href="7678205#7678205" onclick="return false;" title="1-4F">F. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any local law or ordinance of the City of Albany appropriating money or transferring funds, promising or guaranteeing the payment of money or authorizing the issuance and delivery of any bond of the City of Albany or other instruments or evidence of the City's indebtedness.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678206"><a alt="1-4G" class="litem_number" href="7678206#7678206" onclick="return false;" title="1-4G">G. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Local laws or ordinances authorizing the purchase, sale, lease or transfer of property or any lawful contract or obligation.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678207"><a alt="1-4H" class="litem_number" href="7678207#7678207" onclick="return false;" title="1-4H">H. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The levy or imposition of special assessments or charges.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678208"><a alt="1-4I" class="litem_number" href="7678208#7678208" onclick="return false;" title="1-4I">I. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The annexation or dedication of property.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678209"><a alt="1-4J" class="litem_number" href="7678209#7678209" onclick="return false;" title="1-4J">J. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any legislation relating to salaries.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678210"><a alt="1-4K" class="litem_number" href="7678210#7678210" onclick="return false;" title="1-4K">K. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any legislation amending the Zoning Map.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7678211"><a alt="1-4L" class="litem_number" href="7678211#7678211" onclick="return false;" title="1-4L">L. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any legislation adopted subsequent to July 1, 1993.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678212 child"
      id="7678212"
      data-guid="7678212"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="157"
      data-full-title="§ 1-5: Severability."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678212_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678212_label" for="7678212_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678212"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-5
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678212"
    >
Severability.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678212" data-guid="7678212"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678212" data-guid="7678212" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678212_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any clause, sentence, paragraph, section, article, chapter or part of this local law or of any local law, ordinance or resolution included in this Code now or through supplementation shall be adjudged by any court of competent jurisdiction to be invalid, such judgment shall not affect, impair or invalidate the remainder thereof but shall be confined in its operation to the clause, sentence, paragraph, section, article, chapter or part thereof directly involved in the controversy in which such judgment shall have been rendered.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678213 child"
      id="7678213"
      data-guid="7678213"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="158"
      data-full-title="§ 1-6: Copy of Code on file."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678213_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678213_label" for="7678213_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678213"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-6
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678213"
    >
Copy of Code on file.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678213" data-guid="7678213"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678213" data-guid="7678213" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678213_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">A copy of the Code, in loose-leaf form, has been filed in the office of the City Clerk of the City of Albany and shall remain there for use and examination by the public until final action is taken on this local law; and, if this local law shall be adopted, such copy shall be certified by the City Clerk of the City of Albany by impressing thereon the Seal of the City, and such certified copy shall remain on file in the office of said City Clerk, to be made available to persons desiring to examine the same during all times while said Code is in effect. The enactment and publication of this local law, coupled with the availability of a copy of the Code for inspection by the public, shall be deemed, held and considered to be due and legal publication of all provisions of the Code for all purposes.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678214 child"
      id="7678214"
      data-guid="7678214"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="159"
      data-full-title="§ 1-7: Amendments to Code."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678214_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678214_label" for="7678214_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678214"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-7
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678214"
    >
Amendments to Code.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678214" data-guid="7678214"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678214" data-guid="7678214" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678214_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Any and all additions, deletions, amendments or supplements to any of the local laws, ordinances and resolutions known collectively as the "Code of the City of Albany" or any new local laws, ordinances or resolutions, when enacted or adopted in such form as to indicate the intention of the Mayor to be a part thereof, shall be deemed to be incorporated into such Code so that reference to the Code shall be understood and intended to include such additions, deletions, amendments or supplements. Whenever such additions, deletions, amendments or supplements to the Code shall be enacted or adopted, they shall thereafter be printed and, as provided hereunder, inserted in the loose-leaf book containing said Code as amendments and supplements thereto. Nothing contained in this local law shall affect the status of any local law, ordinance or resolution contained herein, and such local laws, ordinances or resolutions may be amended, deleted or changed from time to time as the Mayor deems desirable.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678215 child"
      id="7678215"
      data-guid="7678215"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="160"
      data-full-title="§ 1-8: Code book to be kept up-to-date."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678215_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678215_label" for="7678215_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678215"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-8
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678215"
    >
Code book to be kept up-to-date.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678215" data-guid="7678215"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678215" data-guid="7678215" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678215_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">It shall be the duty of the City Clerk to keep up-to-date the certified copy of the book containing the Code of the City of Albany required to be filed in the office of the City Clerk for use by the public. All changes in said Code and all local laws, ordinances and resolutions adopted by the Mayor and Common Council subsequent to the enactment of this local law in such form as to indicate the intention of said Mayor and Council to be a part of said Code shall, when finally enacted or adopted, be included therein by temporary attachment of copies of such changes, local laws, ordinances or resolutions until such changes, local laws, ordinances or resolutions are printed as supplements to said Code book, at which time such supplements shall be inserted therein. </div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678216 child"
      id="7678216"
      data-guid="7678216"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="161"
      data-full-title="§ 1-9: Sale of Code book; supplementation."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678216_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678216_label" for="7678216_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678216"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-9
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678216"
    >
Sale of Code book; supplementation.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678216" data-guid="7678216"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678216" data-guid="7678216" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678216_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Copies of the Code may be purchased from the City Clerk of the City of Albany upon the payment of a fee to be set, promulgated, amended and collected by the City Clerk, who may also arrange procedures for the periodic supplementation thereof.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678217 child"
      id="7678217"
      data-guid="7678217"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="162"
      data-full-title="§ 1-10: Penalties for tampering with Code."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678217_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678217_label" for="7678217_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678217"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-10
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678217"
    >
Penalties for tampering with Code.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678217" data-guid="7678217"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678217" data-guid="7678217" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678217_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Any person who, without authorization from the City Clerk, changes or amends, by additions or deletions, any part or portion of the Code of the City of Albany or who alters or tampers with such Code in any manner whatsoever which will cause the legislation of the City of Albany to be misrepresented thereby or who violates any other provision of this local law shall be guilty of an offense and shall, upon conviction thereof, be subject to a fine of not more than two hundred fifty dollars ($250.) or imprisonment for a term of not more than fifteen (15) days, or both.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678218 child"
      id="7678218"
      data-guid="7678218"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="163"
      data-full-title="§ 1-11: Changes in previously adopted legislation; new provisions."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678218_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678218_label" for="7678218_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678218"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-11
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678218"
    >
Changes in previously adopted legislation; new provisions.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678218" data-guid="7678218"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678218" data-guid="7678218" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678218_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">In compiling and preparing the local laws, ordinances and resolutions for publication as the Code of the City of Albany, no changes in the meaning or intent of such local laws, ordinances and resolutions have been made, with the following exception: In Chapter <a class="xref" guid="38067105" href="38067105#38067105">375</a>, Zoning, § 375-157C(2) [original Section 1444, Subsection C.2] was amended to read "If there is an adverse effect, then flood damage mitigation measures shall be made a condition of the permit," and § 375-65D(1) [original Section 27-924, Subsection D, Yard Requirements] was amended to delete the following two (2) entries: "Number of houses in a row: three (3). Number of houses in a row: eight (8)." References to the Board of Building, Housing and Zoning Appeals were changed to refer to the Board of Zoning Appeals in the following sections of the Code: §§ <a class="xref" guid="7681937" href="7681937#7681937">151-100</a>, <a class="xref" guid="7682524" href="7682524#7682524">197-13</a>, <a class="xref" guid="7683334" href="7683334#7683334">231-127</a>, 307-20, <a class="xref" guid="7686225" href="7686225#7686225">371-60</a>, 375-50, 375-93A, 375-96, <a class="xref" guid="33429904" href="33429904#33429904">375-107</a> and 375-130. In addition, certain grammatical changes and other minor nonsubstantive changes were made in one (1) or more of said pieces of legislation. It is the intention of the Mayor that all such changes be adopted as part of the Code as if the local laws, ordinances and resolutions had been previously formally amended to read as such.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678219 child"
      id="7678219"
      data-guid="7678219"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="164"
      data-full-title="§ 1-12: Incorporation of provisions into Code."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678219_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678219_label" for="7678219_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678219"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-12
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678219"
    >
Incorporation of provisions into Code.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678219" data-guid="7678219"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678219" data-guid="7678219" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678219_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The provisions of this local law are hereby made Article <a class="xref" guid="7678195" href="7678195#7678195">I</a> of Chapter <a class="xref" guid="7678194" href="7678194#7678194">1</a> of the Code of the City of Albany, such local law to be entitled "General Provisions, Article <a class="xref" guid="7678195" href="7678195#7678195">I</a>, Adoption of Code," and the sections of this local law shall be numbered §§ <a class="xref" guid="7678196" href="7678196#7678196">1-1</a> to <a class="xref" guid="7678220" href="7678220#7678220">1-13</a>, inclusive.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678220 child"
      id="7678220"
      data-guid="7678220"
      data-parent-guid="7678195"
      data-position="165"
      data-full-title="§ 1-13: When effective."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678220_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678220_label" for="7678220_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678220"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-13
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678220"
    >
When effective.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678220" data-guid="7678220"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678220" data-guid="7678220" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678220_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This local law shall take effect immediately upon filing with the Secretary of State of the State of New York.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="positioned contentTitle mediumTitle articleTitle 7678221 customerTitleColor"
       id="7678221"
       data-guid="7678221"
       data-position="166"
       data-full-title="Article II: Interpretation"
       data-code-content-type="article"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
