    <span class="titleNumber">
      Article II
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678221"
    >
Interpretation    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678221" data-guid="7678221"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678221" data-guid="7678221" class="questions"></div>


<div class="article_content content" id="7678221_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Adopted <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">12-19-1994</span> as § 4 of <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 80.112.94</span></span><a class="footnoteref" href="#ft7678221-1" id="ref7678221-1">[1]</a>]</div><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7678221-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7678221-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: This legislation was adopted in the 1983 Code numbering and was redesignated by the Editor to fit the 1995 Code format.</div></div></div></div>                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7678222 child"
      id="7678222"
      data-guid="7678222"
      data-parent-guid="7678221"
      data-position="167"
      data-full-title="§ 1-14: Enforcement personnel."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7678222_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7678222_label" for="7678222_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7678222"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 1-14
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7678222"
    >
Enforcement personnel.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7678222" data-guid="7678222"></div>
        <div id="questions-7678222" data-guid="7678222" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7678222_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">All references to "enforcement officer," "chief officer," "administrator," "Building Superintendent" or "Commissioner" contained in the Code of the City of Albany are hereby amended to mean, specify and include the Building Commissioner of the City of Albany and/or the Chief of the Department of Fire and Emergency Services, or their respective designees.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
